  IncidentDetails:
    isNegative: 1
    incidentName: Mould Outbreak
    chanceToHappen: 15
    incidentDescription: Whilst travelling, the stomachs of your caravan members
      all seem to rumble in unison. Through unspoken communication the caravan slows
      so the food stores can be accessed.  However as several sacks and crates are
      opened the odour of rot becomes immediately apparent.   Hopeful and hungry
      looks turn slightly grim as you discover that a small leak in the wagon has
      allowed water to seep into some of the food and turn a portion mouldy.  You
      are forced to dump all the unsafe food.
    incidentTypeId: 1
    incidentImage: {fileID: 0}
